# T-02A restart seam: publish cold, restart the worker session, then the
# FIRST body edit (a semantics-preserving statement change; the oracle stays
# 8/3-scalar-independent) re-resolves on the RESTORED session (resolver-owned
# lane) and republishes.
```test-case
case { schema: "autolang.case/2", id: "ace-ca-d3.utf8-restart-edit-native", tags: ["ca-d3", "certify"],
 source: { file: "src/utf8-bytes.atomdata", syntax: "atom-data", path: "utf8-bytes.atomdata" }, entry: { mode: "program" },
 checks: [ { id: "certify", adapter: "probe", action: "run", options: { recipe: "abi/resource-foreign-certify-v1",
 abi: { leg: "native" }, steps: [ { op: "query" }, { op: "restart" }, { op: "edit-source", from: "return t939_byte_length", to: "return 0 + t939_byte_length" }, { op: "query" } ] },
 expect: { completion: "success", exit: 8, probe: [ { stages_include: ["source-import"] }, { stages_include: ["source-import"] } ] } } ] }
```
```test-case
case { schema: "autolang.case/2", id: "ace-ca-d3.utf8-restart-edit-c", tags: ["ca-d3", "certify"],
 source: { file: "src/utf8-bytes.atomdata", syntax: "atom-data", path: "utf8-bytes.atomdata" }, entry: { mode: "program" },
 checks: [ { id: "certify", adapter: "probe", action: "run", options: { recipe: "abi/resource-foreign-certify-v1",
 abi: { leg: "c" }, steps: [ { op: "query" }, { op: "restart" }, { op: "edit-source", from: "return t939_byte_length", to: "return 0 + t939_byte_length" }, { op: "query" } ] },
 expect: { completion: "success", exit: 8, probe: [ { stages_include: ["source-import"] }, { stages_include: ["source-import"] } ] } } ] }
```
# S06 — callback-by-name: a NAMED free source fn fills the callback lane
# (no first-class function value); the non-zero ctx seed travels as the next
# ordinary int; the fail deck's callback returns the reviewed -7 status —
# the failure transport (exit 70), never a success sentinel.
